    "num": "15",
    "date_str": "2025-01-06",
    "description": "Signing of Certificate of Handover between Sri Lanka and China on Emergency Humanitarian Assistance Project to Sri Lanka (Rice, Fishing Nets and Housing Facilities)",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12987",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-01-06 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)",
    "decision_details_body": "- The People's Republic of China has provided the following emergency assistance to small-scale fishermen in the Northern and Eastern provinces of Sri Lanka at a cost of Yuan 35.7 million :\n* 75,000 fishing nets for small-scale and low income earning fishermen.\n* 500 prefabricated houses for small-scale and low income earning fishermen.\n* 1,630 tons of rice for small-scale and low income earning fishermen\nAll these items were received by the Ministry of Fisheries, Aquatic and Ocean Resources in the year 2024, and the rice and fishing nets have now been distributed \tamong the selected beneficiaries. Accordingly, the proposal made by the Minister of \tFisheries, Aquatic and Ocean Resources to sign the Certificate of Handover of the said emergency assistance between the People's Republic of China and the \tGovernment of Sri Lanka, was approved by the Cabinet."
  },
