    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=7755",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2017-05-23",
    "decision_details_body": "- The proposal made by the Hon. Minister of Lands, for the  alienation of the following Lands vested in the Land Reform Commission for public purposes, was approved by the Cabinet.  \n\n*\ta plot of land in extent of 07.31 perches situated in the Korathota area in Kaduwela to the Municipal Council Kaduwela for the construction of a Community Centre; and \n\n*\ta plot of land in extent of 05 perches situated in Chilaw to the Multipurpose Co-operative Society Ltd., Chilaw for the construction of a building for a Co-operative Bank."
  },
