    "description": "Landscape Development Project of Mahamewna Uyana",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=3878",
    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-02-09",
    "decision_details_body": "- on a proposal made by Hon. (Dr.) Jagath Balasuriya, Minister of National Heritage, Cabinet approval was granted in principle for the project to improve and uplift the Mahamewna Uyana area.  This will include the renovation and restoration work on the road network within the city of Anuradhapura to facilitate local pilgrims and tourists to patronize the place to pay homage and view the place."
  },
  {
