    "lang": "en",
    "decision_details_title": "Press briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2011-02-02",
    "decision_details_body": "- it was agreed to expand and strengthen the present investigation unit of the Ministry in association with the categories of officers serving under the Minsitry, so as to identify the shortcomings in  National Schools and Colleges of Education and propose remedial measures to the authorities concerned for improving the quality of education."
